# Build output (UseArtifactsOutput centralises this under artifacts/)
artifacts/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
TestResults/

# Tooling
.wrangler/
node_modules/
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.DotSettings.user

# A local code index, regenerated with `graphify update .` and never read by any gate.
graphify-out/

# .claude/settings.json IS committed - it is the permission allowlist, and it is portable.
# settings.local.json is not: it holds hook commands with absolute paths to a particular machine's
# binaries, which name that machine's user and work nowhere else.
.claude/settings.local.json

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Never commit these — keypaste is a secrets tool
*.kdbx
*.kdbx.lock
*.key
*.keyx
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.pfx
secrets.json
.keypaste/

# Business notes live outside this repository (D-0006): benchmarks, pivot conditions, the pricing
# ladder and acquisition notes were deliberately moved to private storage before it was published.
# Listed here because a file sitting in the working tree is one `git add -A` away from being in it,
# which is how this rule gets broken by accident rather than by decision.
keypastebusinessnotes.md
*businessnotes*.md
